      "type": "testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "item_EWcKiR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Great size and feels nice in your hand, the ceramic lining is easy to clean and the cup feels as nice to drink out of with the lid off as it does on. No retained odours or weird spots for coffee to get trapped in inside the lid. An all around fantastic coffee drinking experience.</p>",
            "name": "JUSTIN",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Nomad_Testimonial_3.png"
