        },
        "item_wNF4FB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Very happy with this purchase! The size is perfect for me, easy to hold. My coffee tasted better and it stayed hot for some time.</p>",
            "name": "MARY JO",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Nomad_Testimonial_2.png"
          }
        },
        "item_hBP7Ay": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I love it!! It doesn’t leak or sweat. It is beautifully designed, simple and sleek.</p>",
